hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"76","'Uqba ibn 'Amir reported that he heard the Messenger of Allah"
"77","Ibn 'Abbas reported that he heard the Messenger of Allah"
"78","Jabir ibn 'Abdullah reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"79","Abu Sa'id al-Khudri said that the Messenger of Allah"
"80","Musa ibn 'Ali reported that the Prophet"
"81","Suraqa ibn Ju'shum reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"82","Al-Miqdam ibn Ma'dikarib heard the Messenger of Allah"
"83","It is reported that there was a man who had daughters who was with Ibn\n'Umar when he wished that his daughters were dead. Ibn 'Umar became angry\nand said"
